Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.14,0:01:26.48,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,2000)\c&HF9DFBD&\1a&H37&\t(1300,1300,\c&HDEE6D3&)\t(2540,2540,\c&HF9DFBD&)}纵使心口刺痛 我仍要高声宣扬
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.61,0:01:32.07,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\1a&H4B&}我春日里遇见你
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.07,0:01:36.49,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\1a&H4B&\t(1000,1400,\c&H5F4743&\1a&H00&)}为你的夏日风情 心驰神往
